      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789421415208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why study sparse embeddings?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why study sparse embeddings?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QH-79Bpp4Zu794e3CI0uv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1714.6666666666667,
      "y": -17,
      "width": 807.0192260742188,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1794157054,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 1137398068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789421415208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Exact matching is a feature, not a bug\n2. Learned sparse models solve much of the vocabulary-mismatch problem\n3. Sparse representations work with inverted indexes (Only documents associated \n    with an active query term need to be considered. By contrast, dense retrieval \n    normally uses approximate nearest-neighbour search over vector indexes.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Exact matching is a feature, not a bug\n2. Learned sparse models solve much of the vocabulary-mismatch problem\n3. Sparse representations work with inverted indexes (Only documents associated \n    with an active query term need to be considered. By contrast, dense retrieval \n    normally uses approximate nearest-neighbour search over vector indexes.)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "40OtDkRzKRFzeStgB3PEr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1136.333333333333,
      "y": 1318.25,
      "width": 539.9541625976562,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PkoCjZX4bsE54Cf-8mo9g"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
